*       MADCAP SAMPLE PROGRAM
*       DEFINE A SIMPLE MACRO FOR ADDITION
*
        MACRO   ADD3    A,B,C
        LDA     A
        ADD     B
        ADD     C
        STA     RESULT
        ENDM
*
*       USE THE MACRO
        ADD3    NUM1,NUM2,NUM3
*
NUM1    DATA    5
NUM2    DATA    10
NUM3    DATA    15
RESULT  BSS     1
        END
